// Title: Uninstall Sysinternals Sysmon
// Rule ID: 6a5f68d1-c4b5-46b9-94ee-5324892ea939
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_sysinternals_sysmon_uninstall.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
